    "title": "Ole Miss has its present and future lined up at quarterback - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Taylor Hodges ,\n12 hours ago Ole Miss didn’t hide anything from Deuce Knight. When the Rebels went into the transfer portal last winter, everyone knew about the uncertainty surrounding Trinidad Chambliss’ eligibility for 2026. Knight knew Chambliss could come back. He knew Chambliss would be the unquestioned starter if he did. And he still picked Ole Miss. Read full article",
